  <section class="synthesis" aria-labelledby="synthesis-title">
    <div class="label">One-sentence formulation</div>
    <h2 id="synthesis-title">What the follow-up holds</h2>
    <p class="one-sentence"><strong>The field that the earlier specimen declined to verify became a five-night festival in thirty-one days, because the forms it needed already existed and the public had already chosen them; the specimen is left as it was, and this page adds layers, it does not correct a reading.</strong></p>
    <p class="boundary-note">This is a reading across one external public-discourse field, held at a second fixed date. Institutional reporting confirms that an event opened and that a singer shared its opening stage; it confirms nothing else on this page, and one observed field does not establish a system-wide law. The conditions and the translation named here are readings of one field, not properties of any people or place. Cultural casting remains a public-reading mechanism here, not a factual equivalence, and the candidate formulations remain candidates.</p>
